00:45:36.000 --> 00:46:24.000
However, they weren't sure if it was the same killer and just like the murder of Willamene Kruger, Anna's murder featured no worthwhile leads, suspects or motives. Police were initially hesitant to publicly draw direct parallels between the two murders. However, behind the scenes, the two investigations worked in tandem. Shopkeepers, cafe owners and hotel and motel managers in Wollongong were questioned about Anna. There were rumors she may have spent time in Wollongong at some stage, but with all her different aliases, it was hard to pin down exactly where she had been and whom she had interacted with. Over 1700 people were interviewed in relation to both murders and a

