running down a walkway next to Tattersall's Hotel. More than 50 years later, the depraved, brutal and unsolved murders of Wilhelmina Kruger, Anna Dowling-Kauer, Mary-Anne Schmidt, and Christine Sherrick still horrify the community and stump police. Their deaths leave many unanswered questions of a killer or killers who may still be out there. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
